A||N||22||SloPonti||Some new pictures of the hopped up iron duck!!!||||6||
Z||000000||SloPonti||07-08-2000||02:25 PM||||Well here are some new photos of the car! since the last time i posted i have got some more stuff done to it! i have tinted the back window-i have added new goodyear eagle HP tires and man do i love those tires!!!-i have also added the fiero third brake light addition to the 84 pontiac! also take alook at the little fiero emblems by the doors-you will notice they are red and at night i made them so they light up! this is very very cool at night and i have never seen this done and would like to think i am the first to do this-anyways it looks really cool!<BR>some mods done to the motor are hooker header-comp cam-msd ingintion-performance holley throttle body-ram air-gt dual exhaust with 4.5 inch stainless steel tips-and accell wires! also custom paint on the motor-all of the work on this car was done by me!<BR>i have also rebuilt all of the suspension and brakes! i have replaced every bushing with polyurathane bushings! i also added a factory wing to this car-courtesy of fierodave! the exhasut tips came from super x motorsports along with the winshield logo! i love driving this car! thanks<BR>Rob <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero1.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero2.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero3.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero4.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero4.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero5.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero5.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero6.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/my55ride/fiero6.jpg</A> <P><BR>||||reg||6
